{"seq":3,"slug":"message-passing","title":"消息传递框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/message-passing","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息传递框架\">消息传递框架</h1><p>GCN、GraphSAGE、GAT、GIN——这些模型乍看公式各不相同，但如果你把它们并排写出来，会发现一个惊人的事实：它们都在做同一件事，每个节点反复地从邻居收集信息、再更新自己。Gilmer 等人在 2017 年把这个共性抽象成了<strong>消息传递神经网络（MPNN）</strong>，从此它成了描述绝大多数空间 GNN 的通用语言。这一篇把这个框架讲透，它是读懂<a href=\"../architectures/\">整个核心架构章</a>的钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-聚合-更新两步走\">核心概念：聚合-更新两步走</h2><p>消息传递把一层 GNN 的计算拆成两个步骤。设节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 层的表示是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 层这样算：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步，聚合（Aggregate）</strong>——从所有邻居收集消息并汇总成一个向量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi><munder><mo><mtext>AGG</mtext></mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder></mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>MSG</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i^{(l+1)} = \\underset{j \\in \\mathcal{N}(i)}{\\text{AGG}} \\left( \\text{MSG}(h_i^{(l)}, h_j^{(l)}, e_{ij}) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.116em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSG</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第二步，更新（Update）</strong>——用聚合结果和自己的旧表示算出新表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>UPD</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i^{(l+1)} = \\text{UPD}\\left(h_i^{(l)}, m_i^{(l+1)}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MSG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MSG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是消息函数（怎么从一对节点和边算出一条消息），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是聚合函数（怎么把多条消息汇总），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UPD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UPD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是更新函数（怎么结合自身与聚合结果）。这三个可学习的组件一旦定下来，一个 GNN 就定下来了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    H[&quot;节点 i 的表示 h_i^(l)&quot;] --&gt; MSG[&quot;消息函数 MSG&lt;br/&gt;对每个邻居 j 算一条消息&quot;]&#10;    N[&quot;邻居 j ∈ N(i) 的表示&quot;] --&gt; MSG&#10;    E[&quot;边特征 e_ij&quot;] --&gt; MSG&#10;    MSG --&gt; AGG[&quot;聚合函数 AGG&lt;br/&gt;求和/平均/最大/注意力&quot;]&#10;    AGG --&gt; M[&quot;聚合消息 m_i^(l+1)&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; UPD[&quot;更新函数 UPD&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; UPD&#10;    UPD --&gt; HNEW[&quot;新表示 h_i^(l+1)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    H[\"节点 i 的表示 h_i^(l)\"] --&gt; MSG[\"消息函数 MSG&lt;br/&gt;对每个邻居 j 算一条消息\"]\n    N[\"邻居 j ∈ N(i) 的表示\"] --&gt; MSG\n    E[\"边特征 e_ij\"] --&gt; MSG\n    MSG --&gt; AGG[\"聚合函数 AGG&lt;br/&gt;求和/平均/最大/注意力\"]\n    AGG --&gt; M[\"聚合消息 m_i^(l+1)\"]\n    M --&gt; UPD[\"更新函数 UPD\"]\n    H --&gt; UPD\n    UPD --&gt; HNEW[\"新表示 h_i^(l+1)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"聚合函数必须置换不变\">聚合函数必须置换不变</h2><p>聚合函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 有一条铁律：它必须对邻居的输入顺序<strong>不敏感</strong>。理由在 <a href=\"graph-representation\">图表示与图信号</a> 里讲过——节点没有天然顺序，给邻居换个编号不该改变结果。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 只能是求和、平均、最大值这类对称函数，或者基于注意力的加权和（权重本身由内容决定，与顺序无关）。</p>\n<p>聚合函数的选择直接决定模型的表达能力。下表对比常见聚合方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合函数</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>求和</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>能区分邻居数量与结构，表达力最强</td>\n<td>GIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{N}(i)|}\\sum_j h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3651em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对度数鲁棒，丢失数量信息</td>\n<td>GCN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_j h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>抓显著邻居，丢失分布信息</td>\n<td>GraphSAGE（max 变体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j \\alpha_{ij} h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自适应加权，表达力强但更贵</td>\n<td>GAT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Xu 等人（2019）证明，求和聚合配合一个充分表达的 MLP，能让 GNN 达到 Weisfeiler-Lehman 图同构测试（1-WL）的判别上界，这就是 GIN 的理论依据。平均和最大值则严格弱于求和——比如平均无法区分「一个邻居」和「两个相同的邻居」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表达能力的天花板-与-wl-测试的关系\">表达能力的天花板：与 WL 测试的关系</h2><p>消息传递有一个深刻而扫兴的理论极限：<strong>标准 MPNN 的判别能力不超过 1-WL 测试</strong>。1-WL（Weisfeiler-Lehman）是一个经典的图同构启发式算法，它做的事和消息传递几乎一模一样——反复地用邻居的标签集合去刷新每个节点的标签。</p>\n<p>这意味着：凡是 1-WL 区分不开的两张图，任何标准 MPNN 也区分不开。一个经典反例是两个正六边形 vs 两个三角形——它们的节点都有相同的度数与邻居结构，MPNN 会给出完全相同的表示，尽管它们是不同的图。</p>\n<p>突破这个天花板有几条路：注入位置/结构编码、用高阶（k-WL）消息传递、或者干脆引入全局注意力。最后一条正是 <a href=\"../architectures/graph-transformers\">图 Transformer</a> 的核心动机——让任意两节点直接交互，跳出 1-WL 的局部牢笼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过挤压-信息瓶颈\">过挤压：信息瓶颈</h2><p>消息传递还有一个实践层面的痛点：<strong>过挤压（over-squashing）</strong>。当一个节点需要的信息藏在很远的地方时，这些信息要经过指数级膨胀的路径，被压缩进固定维度的消息向量里，细节就被「挤掉」了。图的某些「瓶颈」结构（连接两个稠密社区的细颈）会让这种压缩尤其严重。</p>\n<p>过挤压和<a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a>是一对相伴的难题，但成因不同：过平滑是层太深导致表示塌缩，过挤压是远程信息在窄通道里丢失。两者都限制了 MPNN 捕捉长程依赖的能力，也都是图 Transformer 试图绕开的问题。这一对问题会在训练章里系统讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用消息传递重写经典模型\">用消息传递重写经典模型</h2><p>框架的威力在于它的统一性。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MSG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MSG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSG</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UPD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UPD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 填成不同的具体函数，就还原出各个经典模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GCN</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MSG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MSG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按度数归一化的邻居表示，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是求和，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UPD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UPD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是线性变换加激活。详见 <a href=\"../architectures/gcn\">GCN</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>GraphSAGE</strong>：先采样固定数量邻居，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 可选 mean/max/LSTM，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UPD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UPD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 把自身表示和聚合结果拼接后变换。详见 <a href=\"../architectures/graphsage-gat\">GraphSAGE 与 GAT</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>GAT</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 用注意力权重加权，权重由节点对内容算出。同样见上篇。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一旦你习惯了用这三个函数去拆解任何 GNN，再复杂的架构都会变得透明：你只需问「它的消息、聚合、更新分别是什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>消息传递（MPNN）把一层 GNN 拆成聚合（从邻居收消息）和更新（结合自身）两步，由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MSG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MSG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSG</span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UPD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UPD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UPD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 三个可学习函数定义。</li>\n<li>聚合函数必须置换不变（求和/平均/最大/注意力），其选择决定表达力：求和最强、平均最鲁棒。</li>\n<li>标准 MPNN 的判别力上限是 1-WL 测试，突破它需位置编码、高阶消息传递或全局注意力。</li>\n<li>过挤压让远程信息在窄通道里丢失，与<a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a>共同限制长程依赖建模。</li>\n<li>几乎所有空间 GNN（GCN/GraphSAGE/GAT）都是该框架的特例，这使它成为读懂 <a href=\"../architectures/\">核心架构章</a> 的通用语言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息传递框架","id":"消息传递框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：聚合-更新两步走","id":"核心概念-聚合-更新两步走"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合函数必须置换不变","id":"聚合函数必须置换不变"},{"level":2,"text":"表达能力的天花板：与 WL 测试的关系","id":"表达能力的天花板-与-wl-测试的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"过挤压：信息瓶颈","id":"过挤压-信息瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"用消息传递重写经典模型","id":"用消息传递重写经典模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"谱方法与图卷积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/spectral-methods"},"next":{"title":"图卷积网络 GCN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/gcn"}}